      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for udisks2 fixes the following issue:\n\n- CVE-2026-7867: insufficient authorization checks on the `as-user` option in the\n  `org.freedesktop.UDisks2.Filesystem.Mount()` D-Bus method can lead to local privilege escalation (bsc#1274430).\n",
